column6:
The following additional taxa were listed in Table 5.1 for quadrats
marginal to eucalypt woodland: Acaculic, Acacia ulicifolia (FAB);
Anisaven, Anisopogon avenaceus (PO); Bosshete, Bossiaea heterophylla
(FAB); Bracdaph, Brachyloma daphnoides (EPACRID); Doryexce,
Doryanthes excelsa (AGAV); Platline, Platysace linearifolia (API);
and Pultscab, Pultenaea scabra var. scabra (FAB).
